    "description": "The dataset contains trail closures and detours on the routes of \"Cycling in Switzerland\" of Switzerland and the Principality of Liechtenstein, which have been announced to SwitzerlandMobility. It complements the \"Cycling in Switzerland\" geodata (Non-motorised transport – Veloland Schweiz), and is managed by the Federal Roads Office FEDRO, the Federal Office of Topography swisstopo, SwitzerlandMobility and the cantons.Link to the disclaimer: https://schweizmobil.ch/en/closures-detours",
